> has changed, though, and now I get these messages after issuieng
> dpkg-buildpackage:
> 
> -- Found Oracle: /usr/lib/oracle/11.1/client64/lib/libclntsh.so
> (ORACLE_HOME='/usr/lib/oracle/11.1/client64')
