1931,"Re: Optical analog computing? (Trial Version)","
--- begin forwarded text


Status: RO
Date: Thu, 03 Oct 2002 03:21:05 +1000
To: ""John S. Denker"" <jsd@monmouth.com>
From: Greg Rose <ggr@qualcomm.com>
