3121,"iSilo announcements (August 15, 2002) (Trial Version)","----------------------------------------------------------------------
1. iSilo(TM) 3.2 for Palm OS and Pocket PC enters beta1
2. iSilo(TM) 3.2 for Windows enters beta1
3. iSiloX 3.2 for Windows and Mac OS enters beta1
