ancestral property of HM King Hermios, to resolve the virtual ""state of
war"" that exists with the United States government and to be accepted as
an honorable state among nations.
The Kingdom does not pretend to be (quoting from the report) ""asserting
authority over land ...within the geographical and political
boundaries..."" of the RMI. We are however striving to expel the armed
