weekly publication. While we do not wear our brief history on our
shirtsleeves, our raison d'Ãªtre is clearly mandated in the Preamble
to
the Constitution of EnenKio, which can be seen at our web site:
http://www.enenkio.wakeisland.org
Referencing the news article in the Marshall Islands Journal entitled
""Kingdom of EnenKio sets up in New Zealand,"" of May 1st, the editor was
