4007,"Re: Where to find setup for env variable? (Trial Version)","Paul Chany wrote:
> Liam O'Toole <liam.p.otoole@csmining.org> writes:
>
>   
>> On 2010-04-14, Paul Chany <csanyipal@csmining.org> wrote:
>>     
>
